g//uploads/thumbs/site_0561_0001-750-0-20121130111704.jpg", "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1544735716-392fe2489ffa?w=1600&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80", "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1564507592333-c60657eea523?w=1600&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80", "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1509023464722-18d996393ca8?w=1600&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80", "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1552832230-c0197dd311b5?w=1600&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80", "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1518709268805-4e9042af9f23?w=1600&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80", "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1581888227599-779811939961?w=1600&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80", "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1548013146-72479768bada?w=1600&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80", "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1568605117036-5fe5e7bab0b7?w=1600&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80", "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1513694203232-719a280e022f?w=1600&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80"], "shortInfo": "Golden Temple of Dambulla\n\nA sacred pilgrimage site for 22 centuries, this cave monastery, with its five sanctuaries, is the largest, best-preserved cave-temple complex in Sri Lanka. The Buddhist mural paintings (covering an area of 2,100 m2 ) are of particular importance, as are the 157 statues. "}, "hist_historic_centre_of_morelia": {"id": "hist_historic_centre_of_morelia", "type": "historical", "name": {"en": "Historic Centre of Morelia", "bn": "Historic Centre of Morelia"}, "country": {"en": "Latin America and the Caribbean", "bn": "Latin America and the Caribbean"}, "subtitle": {"en": "UNESCO World Heritage • Latin America and the Caribbean", "bn": "ইউনেস্কো বিশ্ব ঐতিহ্যবাহী স্থান • Latin America and the Caribbean"}, "lat": 19.7044, "lng": -101.1917, "zoomAltitude": 0.14, "images": ["http://whc.unesco.org//uploads/thumbs/site_0585_0002-750-0-20121204115454.jpg", "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1544735716-392fe2489ffa?w=1600&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80", "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1564507592333-c60657eea523?w=1600&auto=format&fit=